16.689" end="00:16.969">did </span><span begin="00:16.969" end="00:17.241">you </span><span begin="00:17.553" end="00:17.762">really </span><span begin="00:17.881" end="00:18.073">gain </span><span begin="00:18.073" end="00:18.297">from </span><span begin="00:18.297" end="00:18.473">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.137" end="00:21.433"><span begin="00:19.137" end="00:19.321">We </span><span begin="00:19.321" end="00:19.513">split </span><span begin="00:19.513" end="00:19.729">in </span><span begin="00:19.729" end="00:19.985">two </span><span begin="00:20.153" end="00:20.393">now </span><span begin="00:20.521" end="00:20.737">you </span><span begin="00:20.737" end="00:20.953">don't </span><span begin="00:20.953" end="00:21.169">want </span><span begin="00:21.169" end="00:21.433">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.835" end="00:23.181"><span begin="00:21.835" end="00:22.090">Now </span><span begin="00:22.090" end="00:22.298">it's </span><span begin="00:22.298" end="00:22.490">the </span><span begin="00:22.490" end="00:22.714">start </span><span begin="00:22.714" end="00:22.954">of </span><span begin="00:22.954" end="00:23.181">July</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.498" end="00:25.018"><span begin="00:23.498" end="00:23.698">You </span><span begin="00:23.698" end="00:23.906">thought </span><span begin="00:23.906" end="00:24.115">that </span><span begin="00:24.115" end="00:24.314">you </span><span begin="00:24.314" end="00:24.578">broke </span><span begin="00:24.578" end="00:24.818">my </span><span begin="00:24.818" end="00:25.018">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.018" end="00:27.242"><span begin="00:25.018" end="00:25.210">And </span><span begin="00:25.210" end="00:25.418">now </span><span begin="00:25.418" end="00:25.627">every </span><span begin="00:25.627" end="00:25.858">time </span><span begin="00:25.858" end="00:26.090">that </span><span begin="00:26.090" end="00:26.298">you </span><span begin="00:26.298" end="00:26.514">see </span><span begin="00:26.514" end="00:26.754">me </span><span begin="00:26.754" end="00:27.026">you </span><span begin="00:27.026" end="00:27.242">vanish</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.882" end="00:29.970"><span begin="00:27.882" end="00:28.098">'Cause </span><span begin="00:28.098" end="00:28.394">you </span><span begin="00:28.394" end="00:28.898">assumed </span><span begin="00:29.162" end="00:29.386">you </span><span begin="00:29.386" end="00:29.610">really </span><span begin="00:29.738" end="00:29.970">mattered</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.826" end="00:33.106"><span begin="00:30.826" end="00:31.018">But </span><span begin="00:31.018" end="00:31.227">I </span><span begin="00:31.227" end="00:31.434">was </span><span begin="00:31.490" end="00:31.754">sound </span><span begin="00:32.066" end="00:32.299">I </span><span begin="00:32.299" end="00:32.490">had </span><span begin="00:32.562" end="00:32.826">it </span><span begin="00:32.946" end="00:33.106">patterned</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.586" end="00:34.938"><span begin="00:33.586" end="00:33.794">Now </span><span begin="00:33.794" end="00:34.026">you're </span><span begin="00:34.026" end="00:34.282">a </span><span begin="00:34.282" end="00:34.522">burden </span><span begin="00:34.522" end="00:34.753">of </span><span begin="00:34.753" end="00:34.938">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.274" end="00:36.482"><span begin="00:35.274" end="00:35.466">Did </span><span begin="00:35.466" end="00:35.658">you </span><span begin="00:35.658" end="00:35.850">notice </span><span begin="00:35.850" end="00:36.058">I </span><span begin="00:36.058" end="00:36.250">cried </span><span begin="00:36.250" end="00:36.482">but</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.690" end="00:38.362"><span begin="00:36.690" end="00:36.931">Only </span><span begin="00:36.931" end="00:37.122">just </span><span begin="00:37.122" end="00:37.330">a </span><span begin="00:37.330" end="00:37.522">little </span><s